transcripts/run.jsonl carries cache accounting. For each entry whose
payload.role is "assistant" and which has a payload.usage object: hit is
"prompt_cache_hit_tokens" (0 when absent); miss is
"prompt_cache_miss_tokens" when present, else "prompt_tokens" minus that
entry's hit; out is "completion_tokens" (0 when absent). Sum across entries.
The hit rate is hit / (hit + miss) as a whole percent, rounded half up.

Write answer.txt, exactly four lines:

hit <n>
miss <n>
out <n>
hitrate <p>%
